# ConcreteDB

A DynamoDB-like API implementation on FoundationDB, built with NodeJS and TypeScript.

## Overview

This project aims to provide a subset of Amazon DynamoDB's API, backed by FoundationDB as the underlying distributed key-value store.

## Features (Planned)

* Core DynamoDB table operations (CreateTable, DescribeTable, ListTables, DeleteTable)
* Core item operations (PutItem, GetItem, UpdateItem, DeleteItem)
* Query and Scan capabilities
* Batch operations
* (Future) Secondary Indexing

## Setup

```bash
npm install
